            "type": "game",
            "name": "Xmas Shooting - Scramble!!",
            "steam_appid": 560050,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Oferta especial</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/560050/extras/0c9beca021196d9ae55eb49230f36e6b.avif?t=1729154026\" width=542 height=100 /></span><br>All owners of Xmas Shooting - Scramble!! will unlock a free bonus character in <strong>100% Orange Juice</strong> on Steam.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>On Christmas, the night of miracles, someone has stolen all the presents that were supposed to go to the children around the world.<br>In order to get them back, Aru, the bunny-eared Santa, has taken off into the sky, following a subtle trace of the presents.<br><br>Help Aru save Christmas in this humoristic, action-packed shooter set in the universe of QP Shooting - Dangerous!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet unexpected guests on your journey to save Christmas on 3 hilarious Stages<br></li><li>Steam version remastered for high resolutions<br></li><li>4 Difficulty levels - something for every player, from merely challenging to tear-jerking.<br></li><li>3 Play Styles - play with Orthodox, Defensive or Aggressive style, affecting the behavior of your Hyper Mode.<br></li><li>28 Formations to Unlock - earn points to unlock new attack formations for Aru. You can load up to 3 different ReBit formations onto the field, and switch them on the fly.<br></li><li>Arcade and Conquest Mode  - Conquest Mode saves your progress and allows you to progress a stage at a time, striving to do ever better.<br></li><li>Replays - Save replays of your best victories and most miserable failures to study or share.<br></li><li>Presents(?)</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "On Christmas, the night of miracles, someone has stolen all the presents that were supposed to go to the children around the world.<br>In order to get them back, Aru, the bunny-eared Santa, has taken off into the sky, following a subtle trace of the presents.<br><br>Help Aru save Christmas in this humoristic, action-packed shooter set in the universe of QP Shooting - Dangerous!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet unexpected guests on your journey to save Christmas on 3 hilarious Stages<br></li><li>Steam version remastered for high resolutions<br></li><li>4 Difficulty levels - something for every player, from merely challenging to tear-jerking.<br></li><li>3 Play Styles - play with Orthodox, Defensive or Aggressive style, affecting the behavior of your Hyper Mode.<br></li><li>28 Formations to Unlock - earn points to unlock new attack formations for Aru. You can load up to 3 different ReBit formations onto the field, and switch them on the fly.<br></li><li>Arcade and Conquest Mode  - Conquest Mode saves your progress and allows you to progress a stage at a time, striving to do ever better.<br></li><li>Replays - Save replays of your best victories and most miserable failures to study or share.<br></li><li>Presents(?)</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Help Aru save Christmas in this humoristic, action-packed shooter set in the universe of QP Shooting - Dangerous!!",
